{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "旋转数组虽然整体不再有序，但每次取中点后，左右两段中至少有一段仍然升序。先判断有序的一侧是否包含 target，再丢弃不可能的一半；示例中区间依次缩小为 [0,6]、[4,6]、[4,4]，最终在下标 4 找到 0。每轮搜索范围至少减半，因此时间复杂度为 O(log n)，空间复杂度为 O(1)。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>搜索旋转排序数组可视化</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{margin:0;min-height:auto;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.panel-title{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.rule{padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45}\n.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.accent{color:#3794ff;font-weight:600}\n.muted{color:#8d8d8d}\n.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center}\n.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}\n@media(max-width:520px){.grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n.array,.chars,.row-wrap{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}\n.cell,.char,.num-cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:600 14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;transition:.3s}\n.cell .idx,.char .index,.index,.marker{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-top:2px;font-weight:400}\n.cell.active,.cell.mid,.cell.current,.cell.found,.cell.max,.char.active,.num-cell.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.cell.out,.cell.discarded{opacity:.35}\n.card{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#2d2d30}\n.card-label{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-bottom:4px}\n.card-value{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#3794ff}\n.progress{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}\n.dot,.pill{flex:1;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:#3c3c3c;transition:background .3s}\n.dot.on,.pill.on{background:#3794ff}\n.pills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}\n.pills .pill{flex:none;height:auto;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;color:#8d8d8d}\n.pills .pill.active,.pills .pill.on{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.status{margin-top:6px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45;min-height:auto}\n\n.stage{min-height:auto;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;text-align:center;flex:1}\n.stage.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.stage.done{border-color:#3794ff;color:#3794ff}\n.array{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,56px);gap:4px}\n.cell{min-height:48px}\n.cell .value{font-size:14px}\n.pointer{font-size:10px;color:#3794ff}\n\n.array .cell{width:56px;min-height:74px}.pointers{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px;min-height:14px}.cell.mid .pointer,.cell.found .pointer{color:#fff}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>二分搜索：识别有序的一半</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">示例 1：<span class=\"mono\">nums = [4,5,6,7,0,1,2]</span> · target <span class=\"accent mono\">0</span></p>\n<div class=\"pills progress\" aria-label=\"搜索进度\"><div class=\"stage\" id=\"stage0\">第 1 轮</div><div class=\"stage\" id=\"stage1\">第 2 轮</div><div class=\"stage\" id=\"stage2\">第 3 轮</div></div>\n<section class=\"panel\"><div class=\"row\" style=\"justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:6px\"><strong id=\"round\">第 1 轮</strong><span class=\"muted\">区间 <span class=\"mono accent\" id=\"interval\">[0, 6]</span></span></div><div class=\"array\" id=\"array\"></div></section>\n<div class=\"rule\" id=\"message\"></div>\n<div class=\"panel\"><span class=\"card-label\">本轮决策</span> <strong id=\"decision\" class=\"accent\"></strong><div class=\"mono\" id=\"formula\" style=\"margin-top:4px;font-size:12px;color:#d4d4d4\"></div></div>\n<p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">O(log n) 时间 · O(1) 空间</p>\n</main>\n<script>\n\nconst nums=[4,5,6,7,0,1,2];\nconst steps=[\n {l:0,r:6,m:3,msg:'左侧 [4, 5, 6, 7] 升序，但 target = 0 不在 4 到 7 之间，所以目标只能在右侧。',decision:'丢弃下标 0…3',formula:'left = mid + 1 → 4'},\n {l:4,r:6,m:5,msg:'左侧 [0, 1] 升序，且 target = 0 位于 0 到 1 之间，因此保留左侧。',decision:'丢弃下标 5…6',formula:'right = mid - 1 → 4'},\n {l:4,r:4,m:4,msg:'搜索区间只剩一个元素，nums[4] = 0，恰好等于 target。',decision:'返回下标 4',formula:'nums[mid] == target'}\n];\nconst array=document.getElementById('array');\nnums.forEach((n,i)=>{const cell=document.createElement('div');cell.className='cell';cell.dataset.i=i;cell.innerHTML='<div class=\"value\">'+n+'</div><div class=\"index\">下标 '+i+'</div><div class=\"pointers\"></div>';array.appendChild(cell)});\nlet current=0;\nfunction render(){const s=steps[current];document.getElementById('round').textContent='第 '+(current+1)+' 轮';document.getElementById('interval').textContent='['+s.l+', '+s.r+']';document.getElementById('message').textContent=s.msg;document.getElementById('decision').textContent=s.decision;document.getElementById('formula').textContent=s.formula;\n document.querySelectorAll('.stage').forEach((el,i)=>{el.className='stage'+(i===current?' active':i<current?' done':'')});\n document.querySelectorAll('.cell').forEach((cell,i)=>{cell.className='cell '+(i<s.l||i>s.r?'out':'in')+(i===s.m?(current===2?' found':' mid'):'');const p=[];if(i===s.l)p.push('left');if(i===s.m)p.push('mid');if(i===s.r)p.push('right');cell.querySelector('.pointers').innerHTML=p.map(x=>'<span class=\"pointer\">'+x+'</span>').join('')});\n current=(current+1)%steps.length;\n}\nrender();setInterval(render,2200);\n\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": "",
  "time_complexity": "O(log n)",
  "space_complexity": "O(1)",
  "complexity_note": "n 是数组长度, 题目要求元素互不相同. 每轮识别有序半边并排除另一半, 迭代只需边界与中点; 若允许重复元素, 最坏时间可能退化到 O(n)."
}
